Navigation\"><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/buy\">Buy</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/sell\">Sell</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/home-valuation\">Home Valuation</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/communities\">Communities</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/reviews\">Reviews</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/team\">Team</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/about\">About</a><a class=\"nav-link nav-link--active\" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></nav></header><main class=\"site-main\"><section class=\"page page-contact\"><div class=\"\"><header class=\"section-heading\"><p class=\"section-eyebrow\">Contact</p><h2 class=\"section-title\">Let’s talk about your next move</h2></header></div><div class=\"page-body\"><div class=\"\"><p>Whether you’re buying, selling, or just exploring options, we’re here to answer questions and lay out a clear path. Share a bit about what you’re planning and we’ll follow up promptly—usually within one business hour during the day.</p></div><div class=\"page-form-wrapper\"><form class=\"form\"><div class=\"form-row\"><label class=\"form-label\">Name<input class=\"form-input\" type=\"text\" required=\"\" placeholder=\"Your name\" name=\"name\"/></label></div><div class=\"form-row\"><label class=\"form-label\">Email<input class=\"form-input\" type=\"email\" required=\"\" placeholder=\"you@example.com\" name=\"email\"/></label></div><div class=\"form-row\"><label class=\"form-label\">Phone<input class=\"form-input\" type=\"tel\" placeholder=\"(920) 555-1234\" name=\"phone\"/></label></div><div class=\"form-row\"><label class=\"form-label\">I’m looking to:<select class=\"form-input\" name=\"intent\" required=\"\"><option value=\"\" disabled=\"\" selected=\"\">Choose an option</option><option value=\"buy\">Buy a home</option><option value=\"sell\">Sell a home</option><option value=\"both\">Buy and sell</option><option value=\"just-curious\">Just exploring options</option></select></label></div><div class=\"form-row\"><label class=\"form-label\">Message<textarea class=\"form-input\" name=\"message\" rows=\"4\" placeholder=\"Tell us a bit about your situation.\"></textarea></label></div><div class=\"form-row form-actions\"><button class=\"btn btn--primary\">Submit</button></div></form></div><div class=\"contact-direct\"><h3>Prefer to reach out directly?</h3><p>Diane Lathrop —<!-- --> <a href=\"mailto:diane@lathropteam.com\" class=\"link\">diane@lathropteam.com</a> <!-- -->·<!-- --> <a href=\"tel:+19204289227\" class=\"link\">(920) 428-9227</a></p><p>Shane Lathrop —<!-- --> <a href=\"mailto:shane@lathropteam.com\" class=\"link\">shane@lathropteam.com</a> <!-- -->·<!-- --> <a href=\"tel:+19204280066\" class=\"link\">(920) 428-0066</a></p><p>Oliver Lathrop —<!-- --> <a href=\"mailto:oliver@lathropteam.com\" class=\"link\">oliver@lathropteam.com</a> <!-- -->·<!-- --> <a href=\"tel:+19208584424\" class=\"link\">(920) 858-4424</a></p><p>Keller Williams Fox Cities<br/>517 N. Westhill Blvd, Appleton, WI<br/>Each office is independently owned and operated.</p></div></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"site-footer\"><div class=\"site-footer-grid\"><div class=\"footer-brand\"><div class=\"site-logo\"><img alt=\"Lathrop Team logo icon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/logos/lathrop-logo-icon.jpg\"/><span class=\"site-logo-text\">LATHROP TEAM</span></div><p>Three-generation Fox Cities real estate team with a RealTrends verified record and 525+ five-star reviews.</p></div><div><strong>Contact</strong><p>Diane Lathrop · (920) 428-9227 · diane@lathropteam.com</p><p>Shane Lathrop · (920) 428-0066 · shane@lathropteam.com</p><p>Oliver Lathrop · (920) 858-4424 · oliver@lathropteam.com</p></div><div class=\"footer-kw\"><strong>Keller Williams Fox Cities</strong><p>517 N. Westhill Blvd, Appleton, WI</p><p>Each office is independently owned and operated.</p></div></div></footer></div><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-a187ebefcdbd1c61.